\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Lands\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Lands\">Shadow-Cursed Lands</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;8&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;149</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Up ahead the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse\" title=\"Shadow Curse\">Shadow Curse</a> hangs thick, its dark tendrils curling, snuffing out all light and life. Even those with oil-smeared torches are not safe. Turn back now!\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202508\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 689/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6677/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2493/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 17/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 640609/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   24.467      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   24.467      1 -total\n 25.89%    6.334      1 Template:Main_only\n 20.34%    4.977      2 Template:Icon_text\n 16.44%    4.022      1 Template:Notes\n 15.85%    3.877      1 Template:PageSeo\n 15.39%    3.765      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 15.39%    3.765      1 Template:Icon_link\n 15.09%    3.693      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 14.95%    3.658      5 Template:Trim\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:55703-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202508 and revision id 351548. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}